{"sections":{"main":{"type":"main-product","blocks":{"title":{"type":"title","settings":{}},"caption":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"{{ product.metafields.descriptors.subtitle.value }}","text_style":"subtitle"}},"8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/yotpo-product-reviews\/blocks\/star-rating\/eb7dfd7d-db44-4334-bc49-c893b51b36cf","settings":{"product":"{{product}}"}},"price":{"type":"price","settings":{}},"description":{"type":"description","settings":{}},"variant_picker":{"type":"variant_picker","settings":{"picker_type":"button"}},"quantity_selector":{"type":"quantity_selector","settings":{}},"link_Pn3hy9":{"type":"link","settings":{"title":"{{ product.metafields.custom.link_to_title.value }}"}},"buy_buttons":{"type":"buy_buttons","settings":{"show_sticky_cart":true,"is_set":false,"only_tier_gang_button":"Required gang tier not reached","set_size":3,"set_text":"Wähle 3 Produkte","show_dynamic_checkout":false,"gang_url":"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/account\/login"}},"wishlist_engine_product_page_7A3KKB":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/se-wishlist-engine\/blocks\/Product-Page\/8f7c0857-8e71-463d-a168-8e133094753b","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"6d5b98cf-5085-441e-8662-08829574072f":{"type":"shopify:\/\/apps\/klarna-on-site-messaging\/blocks\/app-block\/b95936a9-74b6-4a95-8103-6a1b6459c25e","settings":{"data_key":"credit-promotion-badge","theme":"light","topPadding":"0","bottomPadding":"0","messagePrefix":""}},"recommended_products_9HbPj7":{"type":"recommended_products","settings":{"title":"The Perfect Gifting","content":"","button_text":"Add all to cart","product_list":["giftbox","pomegranate"],"enable_bulk_add":false,"columns_desktop":"2","enable_desktop_slider":false,"columns_mobile":"2","swipe_on_mobile":false}},"0afa8680-aec0-4e0c-95ab-d30e2ae62bb6":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Description","icon":"clipboard","content":"<p>O’Donnell Moonshine’s Roasted Apple Moonshine was one of the first flavours to enter the O'Donnell Moonshine range. A delectable blend of apple, almond, cinnamon and delicate vanilla notes, complemented by  our smooth high-proof spirit.  <\/p><p>A wonderful flavour all year round, Roasted Apple can transport you either to long supper nights in the orchard, or cool, crisp autumn evenings by the fire.<\/p><p>As with all of our Moonshines, Roasted Apple is delicious neat over ice. However, if you're looking for a cocktail recommendation, we suggest mixing it with ginger beer. Simple and extremely tasty. Find more delicious Roasted Apple recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktail page<\/a>.<\/p><p>Bottled in traditional Mason Jars, we promise a unique drinking experience. If you fancy browsing some of our other <strong>delicious drinks<\/strong>, check out the rest of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/all\">shop<\/a> and become part of our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/gang\">Moonshine Gang<\/a> to collect proof points and get unique benefits.<\/p><h5>*Consult our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/pages\/faq\">FAQ's<\/a> for more information.<\/h5>","page":""}},"49300563-c02e-416d-aa9d-730a5612e5b7":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Moonshine Must-Haves","icon":"check_mark","content":"<p>1. Your jar of <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/collections\/moonshine\">Moonshine<\/a>.<\/p><p>2. Our reusable <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/pouring-lid\">Pouring Lid<\/a> to not waste a drop.<\/p>","page":""}},"d51a8f95-ff5d-4d76-a743-b5f8b5808a4b":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Perfect Serve","icon":"bottle","content":"<p><strong>Spicy Roasted Apple<\/strong><\/p><ul><li>80ml <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/products\/roasted-apple?variant=32326858178691\">Roasted Apple<\/a><\/li><li>120ml Spicy Ginger Beer or Ginger Ale<\/li><\/ul><p><\/p><ol><li>pour all ingredients into a glass filled with ice and stir gently<\/li><li>decorate with a few slices of fresh apple<\/li><\/ol><p><\/p><p>You can find more recipes on our <a href=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\" title=\"https:\/\/odonnellmoonshine.co.uk\/blogs\/cocktails\">cocktail blog<\/a>.<\/p>","page":""}},"6f8c618e-28b6-4b1c-8a74-ab060e0f02ce":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Our Loyalty Scheme -  The Gang","icon":"silhouette","content":"<p>Join our loyalty scheme 'The Gang' <a href=\"\/pages\/gang\" title=\"O'Donnell Gang\">here<\/a> to earn points, receive some amazing rewards and gain early access to exciting new products!<\/p>","page":""}},"0ec09e45-091d-4121-875c-4478a825236a":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Allergens","icon":"nut_free","content":"<p>All of our Moonshines, unless indicated otherwise, are allergen free in accordance with Regulation (EU) No 1169\/2011 and amendments. All of our products, unless stated otherwise, are suitable for vegans and those with a gluten intolerance.<\/p><p>All of our spirits are produced using wheat based alcohol. While the distillation process removes gluten from the final product, individuals with certain conditions (i.e coeliac disease) may wish to exercise caution prior to purchase.<\/p>","page":""}},"1767eacb-fd2a-461b-8b16-796c5ec0b009":{"type":"collapsible_tab","settings":{"heading":"Shipping","icon":"truck","content":"<p><strong>£3.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&lt; <\/strong>2kg<br\/><strong>£5.95 <\/strong>for orders <strong>&gt; <\/strong>2kg<\/p><p><strong>Free shipping<\/strong> for orders over £70!<\/p><p>Shipping cost to Northern Ireland is set at £16.95<\/p>","page":""}}},"block_order":["title","caption","8e29b3b3-eb8c-4755-aaec-d317609f4f19","price","description","variant_picker","quantity_selector","link_Pn3hy9","buy_buttons","wishlist_engine_pro